            "title": "About this dashboard",
            "type": "text",
            "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
            "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "This dashboard reads from **InfluxDB 1.x** (database `app`), written to by the `influxdb_v1` collector (`Beberlei\\Metrics\\Collector\\InfluxDbV1`). Every metric is stored as an InfluxDB *measurement* named after the metric (e.g. `homepage.visits`), with its value in a field called `value`. The `$measurement` variable above is populated with `SHOW MEASUREMENTS`, so it lists every metric name ever sent, including custom ones from the form."
            }
        },
        {
            "title": "homepage.visits (guaranteed to exist after the first page load)",
            "type": "timeseries",
